    "name": "Gales of Nayeli",
    "steam_appid": 1878490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/2590869187cd71cb06618e396bf5ab70.avif?t=1751169839\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gales of Nayeli is a grid-based Strategy RPG coming to PC in 2025. In this enthralling SRPG adventure, you will meet and customize your party from a cast of over 35 varied and unique characters.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by classic SRPGs and JRPGs, Gales of Nayeli features an interactive campaign where your choices have lasting consequences throughout the entire game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/a418d71ce7fd1b60ebd53757417f4f4c.poster.avif?t=1751169839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/a418d71ce7fd1b60ebd53757417f4f4c.apng?t=1751169839\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/f998d3af9aad8905ba6ad3a07e7e2161.avif?t=1751169839\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/efbde68b4d5452698408f0f851695541.poster.avif?t=1751169839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/efbde68b4d5452698408f0f851695541.webm?t=1751169839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/efbde68b4d5452698408f0f851695541.mp4?t=1751169839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wave of darkness looms over Iuven. Otherwise friendly woodland spirits and critters are going berserk. Pirates and brigands are threatening Solance. A dark omen looms over the sands of Nareh, following the eradication of the Naga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something must be done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nayeli, chieftain-to-be of the Gaowaga, departs on her journey, uniting unlikely allies in hopes of bringing order back to the land of Iuven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will it be enough to stop the imminent threat looming over Iuven? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/a6bf9036522bab05825838836f7da000.poster.avif?t=1751169839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/a6bf9036522bab05825838836f7da000.apng?t=1751169839\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/b47f52d54aa041251a61cb837d6917be.avif?t=1751169839\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/b84d9c0b4add91d539730c8f45d40f2c.poster.avif?t=1751169839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/b84d9c0b4add91d539730c8f45d40f2c.webm?t=1751169839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/b84d9c0b4add91d539730c8f45d40f2c.mp4?t=1751169839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout the game, every character\u2019s abilities in battle will increase in diverse ways. These increases aren\u2019t simply reflected in their statistics. Entirely new abilities and movement options can be learned through experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will also have a meaningful role to play in every character\u2019s growth. The actions you take throughout the story will grant new skills to characters, both through story choices you make and through the use of skill scrolls, which can teach a skill to any character of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/6ee78f1ecaeecacb7acdef685965d004.poster.avif?t=1751169839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/6ee78f1ecaeecacb7acdef685965d004.apng?t=1751169839\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/2590869187cd71cb06618e396bf5ab70.avif?t=1751169839\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gales of Nayeli is a grid-based Strategy RPG coming to PC in 2025. In this enthralling SRPG adventure, you will meet and customize your party from a cast of over 35 varied and unique characters.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by classic SRPGs and JRPGs, Gales of Nayeli features an interactive campaign where your choices have lasting consequences throughout the entire game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/a418d71ce7fd1b60ebd53757417f4f4c.poster.avif?t=1751169839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/a418d71ce7fd1b60ebd53757417f4f4c.apng?t=1751169839\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/f998d3af9aad8905ba6ad3a07e7e2161.avif?t=1751169839\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/efbde68b4d5452698408f0f851695541.poster.avif?t=1751169839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/efbde68b4d5452698408f0f851695541.webm?t=1751169839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/efbde68b4d5452698408f0f851695541.mp4?t=1751169839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wave of darkness looms over Iuven. Otherwise friendly woodland spirits and critters are going berserk. Pirates and brigands are threatening Solance. A dark omen looms over the sands of Nareh, following the eradication of the Naga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something must be done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nayeli, chieftain-to-be of the Gaowaga, departs on her journey, uniting unlikely allies in hopes of bringing order back to the land of Iuven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will it be enough to stop the imminent threat looming over Iuven? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/a6bf9036522bab05825838836f7da000.poster.avif?t=1751169839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/a6bf9036522bab05825838836f7da000.apng?t=1751169839\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/b47f52d54aa041251a61cb837d6917be.avif?t=1751169839\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/b84d9c0b4add91d539730c8f45d40f2c.poster.avif?t=1751169839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/b84d9c0b4add91d539730c8f45d40f2c.webm?t=1751169839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/b84d9c0b4add91d539730c8f45d40f2c.mp4?t=1751169839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout the game, every character\u2019s abilities in battle will increase in diverse ways. These increases aren\u2019t simply reflected in their statistics. Entirely new abilities and movement options can be learned through experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will also have a meaningful role to play in every character\u2019s growth. The actions you take throughout the story will grant new skills to characters, both through story choices you make and through the use of skill scrolls, which can teach a skill to any character of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/6ee78f1ecaeecacb7acdef685965d004.poster.avif?t=1751169839\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878490/extras/6ee78f1ecaeecacb7acdef685965d004.apng?t=1751169839\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Gales of Nayeli is a Grid-Based Strategy RPG featuring 40+ playable characters. Follow Nayeli as she travels across Iuven on her way to face the tyrant, Bloodlust. Along the way, she will meet victims of Bloodlust\u2019s reign lead the last charge against a darkness that echoes across time and space.",
